/* ==================== Script 766 id="amiyo-imp09-filters" ==================== */
/* Import step 9: more Media filters (your panel already searches and filters by type / favourites / unused).
   A "Show" menu next to Sort adds: Offline (media that needs relinking), Used on timeline, Last import, Long (over 1 min), Short (under 10 s),
   HD or bigger (1080p+), and Audio-only / Has picture. A count shows how many match. "Clear filters" resets it too. */
