  var OPTS=[["any","Show: Everything"],["offline","Offline (needs relink)"],["used","Used on timeline"],["last","Last import"],["long","Long (over 1 min)"],["short","Short (under 10 s)"],["hd","HD or bigger (1080p+)"],["audio","Audio only"],["visual","Has picture"]];
  function usedSet(){ var s=new Set(); (project.tracks||[]).forEach(function(t){ (t.clips||[]).forEach(function(c){ if(c.assetId) s.add(c.assetId); }); }); return s; }
